sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis session
    participant API as Resume service
    participant PDF as PDF parser
    participant Agent as resumeAgent
    participant LLM as ChatGroq
    participant DB as MongoDB
    UI->>GW: POST /api/resume (multipart resume)
    GW->>Redis: GET session:<id>
    Redis-->>GW: Session/user identity
    GW->>API: Proxy request + x-user-id
    API->>PDF: Extract text from uploaded PDF
    PDF-->>API: Resume text
    API->>Agent: resumeAgent(resumeText)
    Agent->>LLM: Invoke JSON-mode prompt
    LLM-->>Agent: Analysis content
    Agent-->>API: Parsed and normalized fields
    API->>DB: Create/update resume record
    DB-->>API: Saved resume
    API->>Redis: SET resume:<userId>
    API-->>GW: 200 analysis response
    GW-->>UI: Resume analysis JSON
